{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17323615","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17323615","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1732361501:1":{"text":"陛下が回復されたのは、王都にとって喜ばしいことよね。","source_cn":"国王陛下恢复了健康，这于王都是件好事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B5E7A754926D353","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732361502:1":{"text":"結局のところ、国家が安定してこそ経済も発展するのだから……","source_cn":"毕竟只有国家稳定，商业经济才能蓬勃发展……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE46D9AB146CE1EBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732361503:1":{"text":"でも問題は、陛下が今後どのような商業政策を進めるのか、まったく読めないという点だ。","source_cn":"但问题是，我们不清楚国王后续会推行怎样的商业政策。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7789F835FDA36861","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1732361504:1":{"text":"これまでの政策は僕たちに有利なもので、それに合わせて調整や計画をしていただけに……","source_cn":"之前王后推行的政策对我们有利，我们也相应调整了计划。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2E14640539B8B70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1732361505:1":{"text":"陛下が政務に復帰した以上、それらの政策がそのまま続くとは限らない。","source_cn":"现在陛下重新执政，那些政策是不是也不作数了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BFB54B167D01A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1732361506:1":{"text":"すべて振り出しに戻った気分だ。本当にどうすればいいのか……","source_cn":"一切都乱了套。我们该怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A33B2681DA34D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1732361507:1":{"text":"落ち着いて！陛下はまだ以前の政策を撤廃するとは一言も言ってない。勝手な想像は混乱を招くだけよ。","source_cn":"冷静点。陛下没有明确说要取消之前的政策，不要胡乱臆想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72A740A38638D631","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1732361508:1":{"text":"今は軽率に動くときじゃない。状況をもっと見極めてから判断しないと……","source_cn":"随意改变计划只会让事情变得更混乱。我们需要进一步了解情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD3C6F3480D5662","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:手工业者卡拉":{"text":"職人のカラ","source":"手工业者卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:手工业者奇科普":{"text":"職人のチコプ","source":"手工业者奇科普","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:手工业者莉娜":{"text":"職人のリナ","source":"手工业者莉娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}